{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46219","headline":"陪冯使君游六首 锦沙墩 · 贯休","name":"陪冯使君游六首 锦沙墩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临水登山兴自奇，锦沙墩上最多时。\n虽云发白孤峯好，其奈名清圣主知。\n草媚莲塘资逸步，云生松壑有新诗。\n翛然别是神仙趣，岂羡东山妓乐随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}